ing over 6 seconds.","Additionally, she is allowed to exceed the attack speed cap and gains a stack of Get Excited! for the same duration, stacking up to 5 times. Only takedowns against enemy champions can grant stacks beyond the first.","Get Excited!: For each stack, Jinx gains 25% total attack speed, up to a maximum of 125%."]}]},{"slot":"Q","variants":[{"name":"Switcheroo!","rows":[{"attribute":"Bonus Attack Speed","modifiers":[{"values":[15,27.5,40,52.5,65],"units":["%","%","%","%","%"]}]},{"attribute":"Attack Speed per Subsequent Stack","modifiers":[{"values":[7.5,13.75,20,26.25,32.5],"units":["%","%","%","%","%"]}]},{"attribute":"Maximum Attack Speed","modifiers":[{"values":[30,55,80,105,130],"units":["%","%","%","%","%"]}]},{"attribute":"Bonus Range","modifiers":[{"values":[80,110,140,170,200],"units":["","","","",""]}]}],"damageType":"PHYSICAL_DAMAGE","effects":["Toggle: Jinx switches between Pow-Pow, her minigun, and Fishbones, her rocket launcher.","Only the first attack after switching to Fishbones will benefit from Rev'd up."]}]},{"slot":"W","variants":[{"name":"Zap!","rows":[{"attribute":"Physical Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[10,60,110,160,210],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[140,140,140,140,140],"units":["% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD"]}]},{"attribute":"Slow","modifiers":[{"values":[40,50,60,70,80],"units":["%","%","%","%","%"]}]}],"damageType":"PHYSICAL_DAMAGE","effects":[]}]},{"slot":"E","variants":[{"name":"Flame Chompers!","rows":[{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[70,120,170,220,270],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[100,100,100,100,100],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]}],"damageType":"MAGIC_DAMAGE","effects":["Each Chomper explodes on contact with an enemy champion, knocking them down and rooting them for 1.5 seconds. Enemy champions can be affected by only one Chomper."]}]},{"slot":"R","variants":[{"name":"Super Mega Death Rocket!","rows":[{"attribute":"Maximum Physical Damage","modifiers":[{"values":